 recommend caution here.** The exact behavioral differences between these modes are not thoroughly documented by Intel, and:\n\n- The modes are relatively new and still being refined\n- Incorrect settings could cause instability or degraded performance\n- Driver versions matter significantly\u2014behavior may differ across releases\n\n## My Recommendation\n\n1. **Start with the default (Mode 1)** unless you have a specific reason to change\n2. **Benchmark** any changes you make\u2014test with your actual workloads (gaming, compute, etc.)\n3. **Check your driver version** and consult the latest Intel documentation or community forums (like the Intel Arc forums or Phoronix discussions) for mode-specific findings\n\nWould you like me to elaborate on any particular aspect, such as how to"}